prop launch zone.id=launch
prop launch zone.radius=5
prop goats creature.count=2
prop dolphins creature.count=2

quest title=Cold Start
quest intro=An old rig among red sea stacks. The manager left a handover for the salvage crew at the top of the landing's ladder.
step reach|landing|1|Tie up at the rig's boat landing
step read|Manager's handover|1|Climb the ladder to the cellar deck and read the manager's handover
step kill|Screecher|2|Drive the screechers off the derrick
step collect|story:startkey|1|Take the start key from the manager's locker in the control room
step collect|story:diesel|1|Cross the rope bridge to the tank stack for diesel
step read|Restart checklist|1|Read the restart checklist on the control desk
step reach|firedeck|1|Cold start the rig - and get down to the cellar deck
step collect|story:valvetag|1|Shut valve one at the wellhead
step collect|story:valvetag|2|Shut valve two in the pump room
step collect|story:valvetag|3|Shut valve three on the flare line
step reach|lifeboatbay|1|Reach the lifeboat bay before its fire door shuts
